WEBVTT

00:00:00.610 --> 00:00:05.490
During the battle royal for the Junior Youth 
Championship, my bracelet lit up.

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:08.740
And I was sent to another dimension.

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:13.160
Yuya and the others weren't in this world.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.320
The escaping D-Wheel has been spotted 
by Duel Chaser 227, on Highway 8.

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:20.480
Currently in pursuit.

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:23.340
The D-Wheel appears to be ignoring orders to halt.

00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:26.070
Requesting permission to stop it by force.

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:29.320
You have permission to force a duel.

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:32.520
Those who fail to follow security's orders

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:35.550
must be taken into custody at once.

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:39.280
I set Field Spell Speed World Neo!

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:43.020
Duel Mode, on. Autopilot, stand by.

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:46.340
A duel!

00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:51.200
A duel is beginning. A duel is beginning.

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:54.970
All cars along the route are requested 
to withdraw at once.

00:00:55.370 --> 00:00:58.870
A duel is beginning. A duel is beginning.

00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:02.480
All cars along the route are requested 
to withdraw at once.

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:03.960
What's your name?

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:07.040
I haven't asked your name yet.

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:09.740
I'm Yuzu. Yuzu Hiiragi.

00:01:09.740 --> 00:01:12.550
Okay. Hold on tight, Yuzu!

00:01:13.110 --> 00:01:16.020
I'll show you what a riding duel is!

00:01:26.030 --> 00:01:29.060
Riding duel... Acceleration!

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:32.650
D-Wheels.

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:36.680
Riding duels are fought while 
racing on these machines,

00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:38.480
which are an evolution of the duel disks.

00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:41.880
They combine speed and thrills for the ultimate show,

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:44.090
a symbol of freedom to all.

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:20.950
Keeping the Peace 
Duel Chasers

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:24.090
Speed World Neo activation complete.

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:26.380
Link to pursuing D-Wheel confirmed.

00:03:26.380 --> 00:03:29.120
They have entered the Speed World Neo domain.

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:32.840
Chief, Duel Chaser 227 is initiating the duel.

00:03:33.240 --> 00:03:34.410
What's their course?

00:03:34.410 --> 00:03:38.920
Tops Residential Zone-City Center, route STC-06.

00:03:40.230 --> 00:03:41.440
Perfect.

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:56.720
I'll go first.

00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:57.830
Let's go!

00:03:57.830 --> 00:03:58.920
My turn!

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:03.880
I summon Speedroid Tri-Eyed Dice from my hand!

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:08.430
When there's a Wind Attribute Monster 
on my side of the field,

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:12.400
I can Special Summon Speedroid 
Taketomborg from my hand!

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:23.530
Level 3 Tri-Eyed Dice tunes Level 3 Taketomborg!

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:27.530
Cross-shaped magical sword,

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:30.140
slice all your enemies with your power!

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:32.480
Synchro Summon!

00:04:32.980 --> 00:04:36.920
Come out, Hi-Speedroid Kendama!

00:04:41.470 --> 00:04:43.060
Synchro Summon?

00:04:44.100 --> 00:04:46.900
Let's go! I activate Kendama's effect!

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:50.830
Once per turn, I can banish a 
Speedroid in my graveyard

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:52.840
to deal 500 points of damage to my opponent.

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:03.750
Yes! I landed the first hit!

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:06.440
I set one card and end my turn.

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:20.430
Hey, hey. Are you actually going 
to duel while you drive?

00:05:20.430 --> 00:05:21.680
You bet.

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:25.290
N-No way!

00:05:29.670 --> 00:05:31.210
L-Look out...

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:35.510
I really think we should get off the bike first!

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:37.880
What now?

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:39.620
They're here, huh?

00:05:42.430 --> 00:05:44.570
Good evening, City residents.

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:48.330
I'm the lead Top City TV reporter, Melissa Claire.

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:53.800
Today, we're bringing you a breathtaking 
chase and exciting riding duel!

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:58.360
Director, a news helicopter has appeared 
in the sky over Speed World.

00:05:58.800 --> 00:05:59.770
Goodness...

00:06:00.370 --> 00:06:04.680
The Tops really are starved for 
entertainment, aren't they?

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:06.080
We have no choice.

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:08.030
It will be a bit of a detour,

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:10.830
but change the route from STC-06 to 11.

00:06:10.830 --> 00:06:11.850
Yes, sir.

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:27.500
Here it comes.

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:35.070
A Duel Chaser, security's pride and joy, 
is in pursuit of two people.

00:06:35.070 --> 00:06:36.840
The duel's first turn is over,

00:06:36.840 --> 00:06:41.500
and the Duel Chaser has taken the first 
hit, with 500 points of damage.

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:43.710
Who will win, and who will lose?

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:46.250
And how will the chase end?

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:48.400
It's a pulse-pounding live broadcast.

00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:50.640
I'm top reporter Melissa Claire,

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:54.460
guaranteeing you the finest in entertainment!

00:06:57.360 --> 00:06:58.960
Come on, now!

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:01.130
The spectators at home are waiting on you!

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:04.210
Allow me to warn you.

00:07:04.210 --> 00:07:08.110
When it comes to riding duels, 
I have a 100% arrest rate.

00:07:08.670 --> 00:07:11.840
I won't lose to a rat like you!

00:07:13.870 --> 00:07:15.210
My turn!

00:07:15.210 --> 00:07:17.670
I summon Jutte Fighter from my hand!

00:07:21.200 --> 00:07:21.790
In addition,

00:07:22.110 --> 00:07:24.730
when you have a Synchro Monster on your field,

00:07:24.730 --> 00:07:28.060
I can lower its attack points by 500,

00:07:28.060 --> 00:07:31.030
to Special Summon Sasumata 
Gardna in defense position.

00:07:38.570 --> 00:07:43.270
In addition, Level 2 Jutte Fighter tunes 
Level 3 Sasumata Gardna!

00:07:45.410 --> 00:07:47.640
Pursue him to the ends of hell.

00:07:47.640 --> 00:07:50.110
Appear, sacred soul!

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:51.580
Synchro Summon!

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:54.240
Come out, Level 5 Goyo Chaser!

00:07:57.810 --> 00:08:00.080
They can Synchro Summon, too?

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:02.990
Then, this really is the Synchro Dimension?

00:08:03.760 --> 00:08:07.660
Go! I attack Kendama with Goyo Chaser!

00:08:16.110 --> 00:08:18.810
The fugitive has taken 200 points of damage!

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:20.280
It isn't over yet.

00:08:20.760 --> 00:08:23.250
Goyo Chaser's effect activates.

00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:26.320
When I destroy a monster by battle with this card,

00:08:26.320 --> 00:08:30.220
I can Special Summon it to my field, 
with its attack points halved.

00:08:33.190 --> 00:08:34.540
What?

00:08:35.520 --> 00:08:38.360
Direct attack with Kendama.

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:41.830
Using my own monster against me? 
That's pretty low!

00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:49.770
That must have hurt.

00:08:49.770 --> 00:08:53.040
The fugitive has taken 1100 damage!

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:55.510
A-Are you okay?

00:08:56.450 --> 00:08:58.020
It's just getting interesting.

00:08:58.020 --> 00:09:01.300
I set one card and end my turn.

00:09:02.490 --> 00:09:05.210
Two turns left, I imagine.

00:09:05.730 --> 00:09:11.260
Amass a security patrol team at 
Point 5, in Town D-block.

00:09:12.060 --> 00:09:15.040
Things should finish up around there.

00:09:15.040 --> 00:09:16.280
Understood.

00:09:16.280 --> 00:09:21.770
In addition, raise the City-wide security level to five,

00:09:21.770 --> 00:09:25.680
to prevent any Commons watching the broadcast 
from taking suspicious action.

00:09:26.100 --> 00:09:28.270
It's a real back and forth...

00:09:28.270 --> 00:09:31.920
How will the fugitive strike back on his next turn?

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:33.840
Let's give it all we've got!

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:34.890
My turn!

00:09:37.150 --> 00:09:40.330
I summon Speedroid Ohajikid!

00:09:44.740 --> 00:09:47.120
The turn I successfully summon this card,

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:51.050
I can choose one Tuner Monster in your graveyard

00:09:51.050 --> 00:09:53.770
to use with Ohajikid for a Synchro Summon.

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:56.730
I choose Jutte Fighter.

00:09:57.800 --> 00:10:00.680
I'll use your monsters, too!

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:07.080
Level 2 Jutte Fighter tunes Level 3 
Speedroid Ohajikid!

00:10:07.890 --> 00:10:09.350
Synchro Summon!

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:13.300
Constantly moving soul of swordplay...

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:18.160
Appear, Level 5 Hi-Speedroid Chanbara!

00:10:21.360 --> 00:10:26.740
Incredible! The fugitive stole the Duel Chaser's 
monster for a Synchro Summon!

00:10:26.740 --> 00:10:31.180
Now, battle! I attack Kendama with Chanbara!

00:10:31.710 --> 00:10:34.490
At the same time, Chanbara's effect activates.

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:39.350
When this card does battle, its attack 
points increase by 100!

00:10:43.320 --> 00:10:44.520
I'm not done yet!

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:49.300
Chanbara's effect allows it to attack 
twice in one Battle Phase.

00:10:50.490 --> 00:10:51.230
What?

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:54.970
Go, Chanbara! Attack Goyo Chaser!

00:10:55.280 --> 00:10:57.760
And when Chanbara does battle,

00:10:57.760 --> 00:11:00.100
its attack points increase by 100.

00:11:07.280 --> 00:11:09.250
All right!

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:14.190
The fugitive's series of attacks has dealt 
consistent damage to the Duel Chaser!

00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:16.650
He's having an unexpectedly difficult fight.

00:11:18.130 --> 00:11:21.780
Sad to say, I've seen three moves in advance.

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:25.360
And on the third move, it's over.

00:11:25.840 --> 00:11:28.910
I activate my trap Descending Lost Star!

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:33.600
This card's effect lets me choose one 
Synchro Monster in my graveyard,

00:11:33.600 --> 00:11:35.610
and Special Summon it in defense position!

00:11:36.310 --> 00:11:39.160
Appear once more, Goyo Chaser!

00:11:42.850 --> 00:11:46.860
But the Special Summoned 
Goyo Chaser loses its effect.

00:11:46.860 --> 00:11:50.010
Its level decreases by 1, and its 
defense points become 0.

00:11:50.010 --> 00:11:52.990
I also can't change its battle position.

00:11:52.990 --> 00:11:57.960
Look at this! The Duel Chaser's 
Goyo Chaser has returned!

00:11:57.960 --> 00:12:00.430
I end my turn.

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:05.080
But you have to give it to this fugitive

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:08.330
for repulsing the Duel Chaser to this degree!

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:09.940
Repulsing him?

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:14.010
And you call yourself a top reporter?

00:12:14.360 --> 00:12:17.480
This is check, I believe...

00:12:30.440 --> 00:12:33.630
The Duel Chaser has gotten ahead of the fugitive!

00:12:34.390 --> 00:12:36.100
Not bad at all.

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:44.510
Now that I'm ahead, I won't let you go left or right.

00:12:44.510 --> 00:12:46.040
There's no getting around me.

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:48.040
Oh, really?

00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:54.250
You're wide open!

00:12:54.840 --> 00:12:55.690
Damn you!

00:12:59.160 --> 00:13:01.050
Th-The fugitive...

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:04.630
Did he ride on the highway wall for a minute?

00:13:04.960 --> 00:13:06.740
Don't be so reckless!

00:13:06.740 --> 00:13:09.850
I told you, if we're caught here, 
we'll be sent to prison!

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:13.580
Then, I won't be able to participate 
in the Friendship Cup.

00:13:14.370 --> 00:13:16.810
And I'll never be able to rise in society!

00:13:20.280 --> 00:13:23.780
In this place, duels are the only 
means of upward mobility.

00:13:24.210 --> 00:13:25.980
To live a proper life...

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:30.960
Duels are a way of life?

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:32.690
Now, bring it!

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:36.810
If you want to catch me, you'll have 
to beat me in this duel!

00:13:36.810 --> 00:13:37.930
You rat...

00:13:38.230 --> 00:13:39.660
My turn!

00:13:39.660 --> 00:13:41.630
I summon Torapart from my hand!

00:13:46.020 --> 00:13:50.140
Torapart tunes Level 4 Goyo Chaser!

00:13:51.920 --> 00:13:54.250
Face the fangs of the wild beast.

00:13:54.750 --> 00:13:56.210
Synchro Summon!

00:13:56.580 --> 00:13:58.890
Level 6 Goyo Predator!

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:01.920
Stop your resistance.

00:14:01.920 --> 00:14:05.220
I attack Chanbara with Goyo Predator!

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:09.820
When Chanbara does battle,

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:12.760
its effect increases its attack points by 100.

00:14:18.680 --> 00:14:22.950
When Goyo Predator destroys an 
opponent monster in battle,

00:14:22.950 --> 00:14:25.510
it can Special Summon that monster.

00:14:29.120 --> 00:14:31.850
Look at this! The fugitive's monster just appeared

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:33.950
on the Duel Chaser's field!

00:14:33.950 --> 00:14:36.190
It's time for the climax!

00:14:36.190 --> 00:14:39.920
Hey, you keep stealing my monsters!

00:14:40.790 --> 00:14:43.900
You're supposed to be security. 
You'll keep using dirty tricks?

00:14:44.280 --> 00:14:47.630
We'll do anything it takes to arrest a fugitive.

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:50.600
Taking you into custody is all that matters.

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:56.540
A direct attack with Chanbara...

00:14:57.020 --> 00:14:59.080
When Chanbara does battle,

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:02.050
its effect raises its attack points by 100!

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:11.190
Chanbara can attack twice.

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:13.930
If we take that next direct attack...

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:16.390
That's right. It's over.

00:15:21.080 --> 00:15:22.300
Checkmate.

00:15:26.260 --> 00:15:28.390
That card he set on the first turn.

00:15:29.300 --> 00:15:30.700
Why hasn't he used it?

00:15:32.900 --> 00:15:36.710
Duel Chaser 227, hold off on 
the second direct attack.

00:15:37.050 --> 00:15:39.550
This will extend my win streak!

00:15:39.550 --> 00:15:41.350
I'll earn a promotion for sure!

00:15:42.030 --> 00:15:45.460
I attack directly with Chanbara again!

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:54.370
I activate my trap card Dice Roll Battle!

00:15:54.840 --> 00:15:59.340
With 1000 or fewer life points, when I 
take an attack from your monster,

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:03.240
this card lets me send one Dice monster 
from my hand to the graveyard,

00:16:03.240 --> 00:16:06.840
and Synchro Summon with another 
component monster in the graveyard.

00:16:06.840 --> 00:16:07.810
What?

00:16:08.090 --> 00:16:11.550
I send Red-Eyed Dice to my graveyard.

00:16:12.430 --> 00:16:14.760
Level 1 Red-Eyed Dice

00:16:14.760 --> 00:16:18.250
tunes Level 6 Kendama in my graveyard!

00:16:21.730 --> 00:16:24.710
Flap your beautiful and heroic wings,

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:27.160
to strike the enemy at the speed of light!

00:16:27.440 --> 00:16:28.630
Synchro Summon!

00:16:29.100 --> 00:16:34.440
Appear, Level 7 Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:16:36.290 --> 00:16:39.230
And Dice Roll Battle's effect

00:16:39.230 --> 00:16:43.610
forces all monsters on your side of the 
field to do battle with Clear Wing!

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:48.590
When it does battle, Chanbara's attack 
points increase by 100.

00:16:49.170 --> 00:16:52.000
However, when the effect of a monster,

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:55.130
Level 5 or higher, activates on the field,

00:16:55.130 --> 00:16:58.200
Clear Wing Synchro Dragon negates 
the effect and destroys the monster!

00:16:58.200 --> 00:16:59.430
What?

00:16:59.430 --> 00:17:01.800
Dichroic Mirror!

00:17:07.200 --> 00:17:07.910
In addition...

00:17:08.480 --> 00:17:12.190
Clear Wing Synchro Dragon's 
attack points increase

00:17:12.190 --> 00:17:15.690
until the end of my turn, by those 
of the monster it destroyed.

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:19.350
4600 attack points?

00:17:20.070 --> 00:17:23.480
Now, the effect of Dice Roll Battle

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:26.320
forces Clear Wing and Goyo Predator to do battle!

00:17:26.620 --> 00:17:28.290
I-Impossible...

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:35.200
Go!

00:17:35.710 --> 00:17:39.670
I attack Goyo Predator with Clear 
Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:17:46.110 --> 00:17:49.750
Whirlwind Hell Dive Slasher!

00:18:04.190 --> 00:18:05.530
Yes!

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:08.830
H-How can this be?

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:13.300
The fugitive has defeated security's 
pride and joy, the Duel Chaser!

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:15.960
When the course clears,

00:18:15.960 --> 00:18:19.540
steer the fugitive toward D-block, Point 5.

00:18:19.940 --> 00:18:21.930
Seal off all exits on the highway,

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:26.220
and quickly increase security 
in the area, just in case.

00:18:26.220 --> 00:18:27.400
Understood.

00:18:28.520 --> 00:18:32.990
227... He's finished.

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:41.130
We're safe now, right?

00:18:41.440 --> 00:18:42.540
Don't be stupid.

00:18:46.170 --> 00:18:47.630
W-Walls?

00:18:47.630 --> 00:18:49.140
Here it comes!

00:18:58.830 --> 00:19:00.250
Shut up already!

00:19:01.380 --> 00:19:02.720
Stop! Stop!

00:19:03.150 --> 00:19:03.950
He's here.

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:17.000
A-After him...

00:19:17.440 --> 00:19:21.340
Incredible! Not only did he win the duel,

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:25.980
the fugitive has escaped the security 
blockade and made it away!

00:19:27.380 --> 00:19:29.650
He's going to get attention...

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:34.620
That's all from Melissa Claire for today!

00:19:34.950 --> 00:19:38.300
Seal off all routes from Town D-block to R-block.

00:19:38.300 --> 00:19:42.580
Have all security patrols rush 
to intercept on the double!

00:19:42.580 --> 00:19:45.790
We have printouts of the fugitive 
and his accomplice.

00:19:45.790 --> 00:19:47.180
Distributing now.

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:09.850
Dimensional travel isn't easy, huh?

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:10.750
Where are we?

00:20:10.750 --> 00:20:13.220
It's probably the Synchro Dimension.

00:20:14.420 --> 00:20:16.190
Yuzu must be around here, somewhere.

00:20:19.640 --> 00:20:22.830
There's another city over the city?

00:20:22.830 --> 00:20:25.640
Where's Gongenzaka? Where are the others?

00:20:29.280 --> 00:20:30.570
We are security.

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:33.540
You are completely surrounded.

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:35.510
What are these guys talking about?

00:20:36.080 --> 00:20:37.310
We've found him.

00:20:37.310 --> 00:20:40.440
He's changed clothes, but his face matches.

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:42.070
His friend is with him, too.

00:20:42.070 --> 00:20:44.180
Secure them immediately.

00:20:47.570 --> 00:20:48.990
Wait, Layra!

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:57.030
Are you okay? This is...

00:20:57.520 --> 00:20:59.120
Real Solid Vision?

00:21:00.060 --> 00:21:01.740
They activated it outside?

00:21:07.440 --> 00:21:11.000
You've been wanted in City since last night!

00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:12.350
Submit peacefully!

00:21:12.640 --> 00:21:15.950
You must be kidding... We just got here.

00:21:15.950 --> 00:21:18.520
Shut up! Surrender peacefully!

00:21:18.520 --> 00:21:21.830
Hey, you! You must think you're pretty hot!

00:21:21.830 --> 00:21:24.120
Who do you think I am?

00:21:24.120 --> 00:21:25.710
I'm Shingo Sawatari!

00:21:25.710 --> 00:21:27.580
No, Sawatari. Wait just—

00:21:27.580 --> 00:21:29.760
You want a duel, do you?!

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:31.180
Sounds perfect.

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:33.800
I'll teach you your place.

00:21:37.970 --> 00:21:39.780
W-Wait, Sawatari...

00:21:41.340 --> 00:21:43.480
H-Hang on. Not you, too, Serena!

00:21:43.770 --> 00:21:46.450
Action Field, on!

00:21:46.780 --> 00:21:49.150
Field Spell Crossover.

00:21:59.100 --> 00:22:00.060
Duel!

00:22:06.270 --> 00:22:08.700
A-Are you kidding me?

00:23:44.180 --> 00:23:49.800
You're under arrest for infiltrating a 
Tops-only area and causing damage.

00:23:49.800 --> 00:23:51.450
Surrender peacefully.

00:23:51.450 --> 00:23:53.920
I don't know anything about this!

00:23:53.920 --> 00:23:56.180
So he's a Synchro Dimension duelist.

00:23:56.440 --> 00:23:58.430
I was expecting a situation like this.

00:23:58.430 --> 00:24:02.400
I'll teach you to know your place!

00:24:02.400 --> 00:24:05.060
Wait, you guys!

00:24:05.360 --> 00:24:09.530
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
Total Security Net!!

00:24:09.530 --> 00:24:11.530
The fun is only getting started!
